### Justification
The claim that Joe Biden explicitly stated an 8-year-old has "a right to transition" is a misrepresentation; during an [October 15, 2020 town hall](https://finance.yahoo.com/news/joe-biden-promises-mom-transgender-170710065.html), his verbatim statement, as documented by [multiple sources](https://www.cbsnews.com/news/biden-town-hall-transgender-rights-zero-discrimination/), focused on the principle of "zero discrimination" for transgender children, not on asserting a specific "right to transition." The claim therefore constitutes an example of cherry-picking, as it alters the substantive emphasis of his remarks.